    <img
      src="/images/official/roblox/icon.png"
      alt="Official Roblox icon for Ragdoll Sandbox, a pale ragdoll and the game logo"
      width="512"
      height="512"
    />
    <p class="kicker">404</p>
    <h1>That page is not on this guide.</h1>
    <p>This site has a homepage, a codes page, and a short gameplay guide for Ragdoll Sandbox. It does not invent a missing route.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="/codes">Codes</a></li>
      <li><a href="/guide">Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
    </ul>
  </main>
